/-! T2 target assembly: the 19 D12 cells 0-18 (unit balance). Per cell (namespace `ThomsonCompact.Target.Cells.<cell>`): the old
accepted height model `heightFinal` through the reverse bridge (`ofBoxes_sound`), the affine exponent, the
